        {
            "title": "Bun has been Cancelled",
            "date": "2024-02-04 13:43:38",
            "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5582843074952557252",
            "content": "[b] I am sorry to say that Bun has been officially cancelled.[/b] During the planning phase of trying to revamp the platforming, story and pet mechanics, I started to realize how much time each of these upgrades would take just didn't match up with the amount of time I have available to make games as a solo developer. It took me a while to come to terms with this, but I know it's for the best that I move on and get to work applying everything I learned to something new.\n\nThank you all so much for your support over the last few years. I couldn't have gotten as far as I did without you.\n- Erik\n\nTo follow what comes next for my game development journey...\n[list]\n[*] [url=https://discord.gg/ueM4DVvP3D]Join the Discord[/url]\n[*] [url=https://www.youtube.com/@editdev]Subscribe on YouTube[/url]\n[/list]"
        },
